--- !u!114 &114942363766364548
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1417630631483470}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: cbdfddbb1a7e9dedeeccda6985376314, type: 3}
  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  itemId: 296
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: 这诛仙剑阵由四把魔剑构成，戮仙剑便是其中一把。其余则分别为诛仙剑。绝仙剑和陷仙剑。此四把剑各有所长，以任何一柄作为阵眼，皆可发挥不同妙用。
  description:
  AvatarIDSetType: 0
  AvatarID: {fileID: 0}
  AvatarIntID: 621
  character: {fileID: 0}
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  voiceOverClip: {fileID: 0}
