  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  itemId: 334
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: 宁州古迹看似是难得一见的福缘之地，但其中隐藏的危险与杀机足以令人万劫不复。机遇总是与风险并行，日后如有机会前往古迹，{FirstName}小友定要牢记这句话。
  description:
  AvatarIDSetType: 0
  AvatarID: {fileID: 0}
  AvatarIntID: 621
  character: {fileID: 0}
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  voiceOverClip: {fileID: 0}
  showAlways: 1
  showCount: 1
  extendPrevious: 0
  fadeWhenDone: 1
  waitForClick: 1
  stopVoiceover: 1
  waitForVO: 0
  setSayDialog: {fileID: 0}
